# NOTE: the dragon model, texture and animations WERE gitignored while their licence was unknown.
# They are now committed: the source model is CC BY 4.0, which permits redistribution and
# modification. See DRAGON_CREDITS.md for the required attribution.

# Local-only audio: an OPTIONAL roar installed by tools/install_summon_roar.sh from a file the user
# supplies. Deliberately NOT committed - the file this was built for could not be cleared for
# redistribution, and this repository is public under MIT and ships a jar. The mod plays correctly
# without it; summon_buildup.ogg and summon_reveal.ogg are synthesised from scratch and ARE
# committed. Full metadata analysis in AUDIO_CREDITS.md.
src/main/resources/assets/rasengan/sounds/summon_roar.ogg

